# AFTERMA API reference

Base URL: `http://localhost:5000`

Protected endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer <JWT>`. User and doctor tokens are supported where an endpoint requires authentication. Unless noted otherwise, successful reads and updates return `200`, creates return `201`, and missing records return `404`. The route inventory below reflects the routes mounted by `server.js`; operations not listed are not implemented.

## Authentication — `/api/auth`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/register` | Public | Register a user |
| `POST` | `/login` | Public | Authenticate a user |
| `POST` | `/google` | Public | Authenticate with Google |
| `GET` | `/me` | Protected | Get the authenticated user's profile |
| `POST` | `/doctor/register` | Public | Register a doctor |
| `POST` | `/doctor/login` | Public | Authenticate a doctor |

Token refresh, OTP, and password-change endpoints are not registered under `/api/auth`.

## Users — `/api/users`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/me` | Protected | Read the authenticated user's profile |
| `PATCH` | `/me` | Protected | Update allowed profile fields |
| `DELETE` | `/me` | Protected | Deactivate the authenticated user's account (`is_active: false`) |
| `GET` | `/` | Admin | List users; supports `role`, `phase`, `active`, `page`, and `limit` |
| `GET` | `/:id` | Admin | Read a user |
| `PATCH` | `/:id` | Admin | Update allowed profile fields, `role`, and `is_active` |
| `DELETE` | `/:id` | Admin | Permanently delete a user |

User creation is not exposed as a users CRUD endpoint; user accounts are created through `POST /api/auth/register`.

## Doctors — `/api/doctors`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/` | Public | List active doctors; supports `specialization`, `location`, `available`, `page`, and `limit` |
| `GET` | `/:id` | Public | Read an active doctor |
| `POST` | `/` | Admin | Create a doctor profile |
| `PATCH` | `/:id` | Admin | Update allowed doctor fields |
| `DELETE` | `/:id` | Admin | Soft-delete by setting `active: false` |
| `DELETE` | `/:id/hard` | Admin | Permanently delete a doctor |
| `GET` | `/me` | Doctor | Read the authenticated doctor's profile |
| `PATCH` | `/me` | Doctor | Update allowed profile fields; cannot self-verify or self-deactivate |
| `PATCH` | `/me/password` | Doctor | Change the authenticated doctor's password |
| `DELETE` | `/me` | Doctor | Deactivate the authenticated doctor's account |

## Sessions — `/api/sessions`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/` | Protected | Book a session |
| `GET` | `/me` | Protected | List the authenticated user's sessions |
| `PATCH` | `/:id/cancel` | Protected | Cancel the authenticated user's session |
| `GET` | `/` | Admin | List all sessions |

Reading one session by ID, general session updates, and session deletion are not implemented.

## Daily logs — `/api/logs`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/` | Protected | Create or upsert the authenticated user's log for a date |
| `GET` | `/me` | Protected | List the authenticated user's logs; `limit` defaults to 30 |

Reading, updating, or deleting an individual daily log is not implemented.

## Lactation logs — `/api/lactation`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/` | Protected | Create a log for the authenticated user |
| `GET` | `/me` | Protected | List the authenticated user's logs |
| `DELETE` | `/:id` | Protected | Delete a log belonging to the authenticated user |

Updating an existing lactation log is not implemented.

## Period logs — `/api/period`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/` | Protected | Create a cycle log for the authenticated user |
| `GET` | `/me` | Protected | List the authenticated user's logs |
| `PATCH` | `/:id` | Protected | Update a log belonging to the authenticated user |

Deleting a period log is not implemented.

## Communities — `/api/communities`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/` | Public | List active communities |
| `PATCH` | `/:id/join` | Protected | Increment the community member count |
| `PATCH` | `/:id/leave` | Protected | Decrement the community member count |

Community creation, individual reads, updates, and deletion are not implemented. Join and leave update only the aggregate member count; membership is not tracked.

## Medicines — `/api/medicines`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/` | Public | List active medicines |

Medicine creation, individual reads, updates, and deletion are not implemented.

## NGOs — `/api/ngos`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/` | Public | List NGOs with `active_support: true` |

NGO creation, individual reads, updates, and deletion are not implemented.

## Insurance plans — `/api/insurance`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/` | Public | List active insurance plans |

Insurance-plan creation, individual reads, updates, and deletion are not implemented.

## Questions — `/api/questions`

| Method | Path | Access | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/` | Public | List questions; supports `category`, `search`, `sort`, `limit`, and `page` |
| `GET` | `/:id` | Public | Read a question and increment its view count |
| `POST` | `/` | Protected | Create a question |
| `POST` | `/:id/answer` | Protected | Add an answer |
| `PATCH` | `/:id/upvote` | Protected | Increment the upvote count |
| `DELETE` | `/:id` | Protected | Delete a question owned by the caller; admins may delete any question |

Updating an existing question is not implemented.

## Other resources

No `/api/medical-profile` routes are mounted. Calendar routes are not registered under `/api/users`; those resources are not part of the current API route surface.
